abstract: >
  LGD-JSON is a JSON format for representing geographic, built-environment, and building 
  construction data
  as a linked graph of typed nodes connected by directed relations. It integrates
  integer geometry with explicit precision, optional ontology binding, and
  multi-file distribution support.
